   "source": [
    "# Cálculo Numérico — Atividade Prática II\n",
    "## Estabilidade e overflow em difusão de quantidade de movimento (escoamento de Couette)\n",
    "\n"
    "\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "e8e41bc3",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 1. Verificação da estabilidade\n",
    "\n",
    "Dados do problema:\n",
    "\n",
    "- $H = 0{,}01$ m\n",
    "- $\\nu = 10^{-4}$ m²/s\n",
    "- 21 pontos, incluindo as paredes $\\Rightarrow \\Delta y = H/(21-1)$\n",
    "- $U = 1$ m/s\n",
    "\n",
    "O limite de estabilidade do esquema explícito é\n",
    "$$\\Delta t_{max} = \\frac{\\Delta y^2}{2\\nu}$$\n",
    "\n",
    "Calculamos abaixo $\\Delta y$, $\\Delta t_{max}$ e o valor de $r$ para os\n",
    "casos A ($\\Delta t = 0{,}001$ s) e B ($\\Delta t = 0{,}002$ s), classificando\n",
    "cada um como estável ou instável **antes** de rodar a simulação."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 1,
   "id": "2792ec01",
   "metadata": {
    "execution": {
     "iopub.execute_input": "2026-09-02T17:14:16.695491Z",
     "iopub.status.busy": "2026-09-02T17:14:16.695047Z",
     "iopub.status.idle": "2026-09-02T17:14:18.598085Z",
     "shell.execute_reply": "2026-09-02T17:14:18.596913Z"
    },
    "lines_to_next_cell": 1
   },
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "dy = 0.0005 m\n",
      "dt_max = 0.0012499999999999998 s\n",
      "\n",
      "Caso A: dt = 0.001 s -> r = 0.4000  =>  ESTÁVEL (r <= 1/2)\n",
      "Caso B: dt = 0.002 s -> r = 0.8000  =>  INSTÁVEL (r > 1/2)\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "import numpy as np\n",
    "import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n",
    "import pandas as pd\n",
    "\n",
    "H = 0.01\n",
    "nu = 1e-4\n",
    "pontos = 21\n",
    "U = 1.0\n",
    "\n",
    "dy = H / (pontos - 1)\n",
    "dt_max = dy**2 / (2 * nu)\n",
    "\n",
    "casos_teoricos = {\n",
    "    \"Caso A\": 0.001,\n",
    "    \"Caso B\": 0.002,\n",
    "}\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f\"dy = {dy} m\")\n",
    "print(f\"dt_max = {dt_max} s\\n\")\n",
    "\n",
    "for nome, dt in casos_teoricos.items():\n",
    "    r = nu * dt / dy**2\n",
    "    estavel = \"ESTÁVEL (r <= 1/2)\" if r <= 0.5 else \"INSTÁVEL (r > 1/2)\"\n",
    "    print(f\"{nome}: dt = {dt} s -> r = {r:.4f}  =>  {estavel}\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "0cbcf644",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "**Classificação prévia:**\n",
    "\n",
    "- Caso A ($\\Delta t = 0{,}001$ s): $r = 0{,}4 \\le 0{,}5$ → esperado **estável**.\n",
    "- Caso B ($\\Delta t = 0{,}002$ s): $r = 0{,}8 > 0{,}5$ → esperado **instável**,\n",
    "  podendo evoluir para overflow.\n",
    "\n",
    "Isso é coerente com $\\Delta t_{max} = 0{,}00125$ s: o Caso A está abaixo\n",
    "desse limite, e o Caso B está acima."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "52df4807",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 2. Detecção de overflow\n",
    "\n",
    "Função de simulação (fornecida no roteiro), que registra o maior módulo\n",
    "de velocidade a cada passo e interrompe a execução ao detectar\n",
    "overflow/operação inválida."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 2,
   "id": "309212f8",
   "metadata": {
    "execution": {
     "iopub.execute_input": "2026-09-02T17:14:18.601010Z",
     "iopub.status.busy": "2026-09-02T17:14:18.600107Z",
     "iopub.status.idle": "2026-09-02T17:14:18.640965Z",
     "shell.execute_reply": "2026-09-02T17:14:18.640157Z"
    }
   },
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "Maior float32: 3.4028235e+38\n",
      "Maior float64: 1.7976931348623157e+308\n",
      "dt=0.001, float32: 2000 passos sem overflow.\n",
      "dt=0.002, float32: falha no passo 121, t=0.2420 s - overflow encountered in subtract\n",
      "dt=0.001, float64: 2000 passos sem overflow.\n",
      "dt=0.002, float64: falha no passo 917, t=1.8340 s - overflow encountered in add\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "def simular(dt, tipo=np.float32, passos=2000, pontos=21):\n",
    "    \"\"\"Simula difusao de velocidade e detecta falhas.\"\"\"\n",
    "    H = 0.01\n",
    "    nu = 1e-4\n",
    "    y = np.linspace(0, H, pontos)\n",
    "    dy = H / (pontos - 1)\n",
    "\n",
    "    # Coeficientes no tipo numerico escolhido.\n",
    "    r = tipo(nu * dt / dy**2)\n",
    "    dois = tipo(2)\n",
    "\n",
    "    # Fluido parado e placa em y=0 em movimento.\n",
    "    u = np.zeros(pontos, dtype=tipo)\n",
    "    u[0] = tipo(1)\n",
    "\n",
    "    tempos = [0.0]\n",
    "    maximos = [float(np.max(np.abs(u)))]\n",
    "    falha = None\n",
    "\n",
    "    # Transforma avisos numericos em excecoes.\n",
    "    with np.errstate(over=\"raise\", invalid=\"raise\"):\n",
    "        for passo in range(1, passos + 1):\n",
    "            try:\n",
    "                novo = u.copy()\n",
    "                # Atualiza o interior e preserva as paredes.\n",
    "                novo[1:-1] = (\n",
    "                    u[1:-1]\n",
    "                    + r * (\n",
    "                        u[2:] - dois * u[1:-1] + u[:-2]\n",
    "                    )\n",
    "                )\n",
    "            except FloatingPointError as erro:\n",
    "                falha = passo\n",
    "                print(\n",
    "                    f\"dt={dt}, {tipo.__name__}: \"\n",
    "                    f\"falha no passo {passo}, \"\n",
    "                    f\"t={passo * dt:.4f} s - {erro}\"\n",
    "                )\n",
    "                break\n",
    "            u = novo\n",
    "            tempos.append(passo * dt)\n",
    "            maximos.append(float(np.max(np.abs(u))))\n",
    "\n",
    "    if falha is None:\n",
    "        print(\n",
    "            f\"dt={dt}, {tipo.__name__}: \"\n",
    "            f\"{passos} passos sem overflow.\"\n",
    "        )\n",
    "\n",
    "    return {\n",
    "        \"y\": y,\n",
    "        \"u\": u,\n",
    "        \"tempos\": tempos,\n",
    "        \"maximos\": maximos,\n",
    "        \"r\": float(r),\n",
    "        \"falha\": falha,\n",
    "    }\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"Maior float32:\", np.finfo(np.float32).max)\n",
    "print(\"Maior float64:\", np.finfo(np.float64).max)\n",
    "\n",
    "resultados = {}\n",
    "for tipo in (np.float32, np.float64):\n",
    "    for dt in (0.001, 0.002):\n",
    "        nome = f\"{tipo.__name__}, dt={dt}\"\n",
    "        resultados[nome] = simular(dt, tipo)"
   ]
  },
